   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Timers on the box take one lock, so an apply, a publish and a snapshot never walk the database\nat the same time. Common board views (unfiltered, tech roles, Israel) are answered from the\nprecomputed artifacts in under 0.1 s; everything else is computed live.",
   "originalText": "Timers on the box take one lock, so an apply, a publish and a snapshot never walk the database at the same time. Common board views (unfiltered, tech roles, Israel) are answered from the precomputed artifacts in under 0.1 s; everything else is computed live.",
